{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-03-31 07:45:00', 'title': "LINDE STARTS UP SUPPLY TO WORLD'S FIRST HYDROGEN FERRY", 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / MARCH 31, 2023 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEGUN THE SUPPLY OF LIQUID HYDROGEN TO THE WORLD'S FIRST OPERATIONAL HYDROGEN-POWERED FERRY FOR CARS AND PASSENGERS IN NORWAY. LINDE IS SUPPLYING FERRY OPERATOR NORLED WITH CLEAN HYDROGEN FOR THE FUEL-CELL POWERED MF HYDRA."}